只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The most comprehensive DeepSeek Harness plugin market — refreshed daily, sourced across the Internet, reviewed before publishing.","id":"gh:1345710688","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-shop","slug":"LivXue/dsh-plugin-shop","topics":["agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-plugin","harness"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The most comprehensive DeepSeek Harness plugin market — refreshed daily, sourced across the Internet"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", reviewed before publishing."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-shop"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**The plugin shop for DeepSeek Harness** — browse, install,\nenable, disable, and update dsh plugins,"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" with every catalog change tracked in Git."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 📦 Install the shop"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Install the shop manually, or have an agent follow the automated steps below."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 🧑 Manual installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Prerequisite:** Node.js. You can run DeepSeek Harness without a global installation\nusing the comm"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"and in its official documentation: `npx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh web`.\nPlugin management uses `dsh plugin"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"`, which invokes both `dsh` and `pnpm`.\nInstall these tools with `npm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh pn"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"pm`, then check that both\nare available with `dsh --version` and `pnpm --version`."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Replace `web` with your profile name if you use a different one. Restart `dsh` after\ninstallation to"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" load the new plugin, then open:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> **Plugin shop** in the left sidebar"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 🤖 Installation with an agent"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"An agent can run these steps without interaction. **The `--profile` option is required.**\nIf it is o"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"mitted, `dsh plugin` exits with this error:\n`error: required option '--profile <name>' not specified"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"tted, `dsh plugin` exits with this error:\n`error: required option '--profile <name>' not specified`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"You can also verify step 3 by checking that `dsh.profile.bundles` in\n`$DSH_HOME/profiles/<profile>/p"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ackage.json` includes the plugin. For troubleshooting,\nsee the package README."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 🖼️ Screenshots"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"A plugin your dsh would refuse to install says why on its card\nThe plugin shop in dark mode"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## ✨ Highlights"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **🌐 Automatic discovery** — the catalog collects npm packages with the\n`dsh-plugin` or `deepseek-h"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"arness` keyword and GitHub repositories with either\ntopic. Authors do not need to submit an applicat"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ion or join a queue.\n- **🧹 Strict screening** — every candidate is checked automatically on each bui"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ld.\nRejected plugins are recorded by name with one of seventeen predefined reasons\nand a detailed ex"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"planation to help authors troubleshoot. The `plugins` and\n`filtered` badges above show the current t"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"otals.\n- **🔌 Local dependency checks** — the shop checks each peer dependency a plugin\nrequires agai"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"nst your profile and the modules dsh's web client provides. When the\nauthor declares which dsh versi"},{"id":"p19s8","text":"ons or profiles a plugin supports, the shop also\ncompares them with what you run. A card shows **Inc"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"ompatible** only when a\ndependency is missing from your environment or the author's declared support"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"\ndoes not cover it.\n- **🗓️ Daily updates** — the catalog is rebuilt daily, with changes committed to"},{"id":"p19s11","text":"\nGit for review. Eligible new plugins are listed the next morning, and plugins\nwhose repositories ar"},{"id":"p19s12","text":"e no longer available are removed during the same process.\n- **🗂️ Seven categories** — authors can c"},{"id":"p19s13","text":"hoose a category through `dsh.catalog`.\nOtherwise, the build assigns one automatically.\n- **🎨 Icons "},{"id":"p19s14","text":"from the package** — every card and installed row draws the plugin's\nown icon, with the shop's defau"},{"id":"p19s15","text":"lt artwork when a package declares none.\n- **🖥️ A layout that uses the width** — on a wide tab the c"},{"id":"p19s16","text":"ontrols become a\nsticky filter rail beside a two-column card grid; narrower tabs keep the\nwrapping c"},{"id":"p19s17","text":"ategory chips and gain two columns as soon as they fit.\n- **🐞 Failures you can report** — a failed i"},{"id":"p19s18","text":"nstall offers a prefilled GitHub\nissue against the plugin's own repository: what you did, the host's"},{"id":"p19s19","text":" detail\nand the last 20 log lines. A repository the shop cannot recognise gets no\nlink, because a re"},{"id":"p19s20","text":"port on the wrong repository is worse than none.\n- **🔄 A shelf that keeps up** — returning to the sh"},{"id":"p19s21","text":"op's tab refreshes the\ncatalog, at most once every five minutes; a failed refresh keeps the shelf\nyo"},{"id":"p19s22","text":"hes the\ncatalog, at most once every five minutes; a failed refresh keeps the shelf\nyou were reading."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 🗺️ How it works"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**The catalog is built daily in this repository.** The build code lives in `registry/`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**The shop runs locally as an npm package.** Its code lives in `packages/dsh-plugin-shop/`.\nThe cata"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"log build and the local shop share a data schema; their code is independent."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Two details are useful to understand:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Every rejected plugin is documented.** The build report records its name and\nexplains which chec"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"k it failed, so authors can investigate.\n- **Compatibility depends on your local environment.** The "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"catalog records the\n*names* of the peer dependencies a plugin requires, without version ranges.\nNear"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ly all dsh plugins declare `\"*\"`, but the harness's prereleases do not\nsatisfy ordinary version rang"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"es. Checking those ranges would incorrectly mark\nworking plugins as incompatible. Instead, the shop "},{"id":"p26s6","text":"checks whether each\ndependency is available in your profile or provided by dsh's web client."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## ✅ Project principles"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| **Open to the community** | Publish to npm with the `dsh-plugin` or `deepseek-harness` keyword to "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"make your plugin discoverable. No separate submission to this project is needed. |\n| **Traceable cha"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"nges** | Catalog updates are committed to Git daily, so you can inspect each change and its history."},{"id":"p28s4","text":" |\n| **Explicit trust levels** | A human review applies only to the exact version reviewed. Other ve"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"rsions cannot inherit that status, preventing an author from using an earlier review to endorse a ma"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"licious release. **Currently, `registry/verified.yml` is empty: no catalog entries have been reviewe"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"d by a human, and all plugins are in the community tier.** Automated screening cannot replace a revi"},{"id":"p28s8","text":"ew of the plugin's code. |\n| **Restricted UI permissions** | The browser interface has no network or"},{"id":"p28s9","text":" filesystem access. Compromising it does not grant runtime privileges. |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🚫 Permissions and limitations"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> **The shop does not provide sandbox isolation.** Once loaded, a dsh plugin has\n> access to the ful"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"l `ctx`, including your filesystem, shell, and requests sent to\n> the model. Installing a plugin mea"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ns trusting it with these permissions. The shop\n> does not restrict what a running plugin can do."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The shop does not display download counts, ratings, or reviews, and it will not offer\ninstallation f"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"rom arbitrary URLs. For that, use `dsh plugin add` and decide whether to\nallow build scripts or pin "},{"id":"p31s3","text":". For that, use `dsh plugin add` and decide whether to\nallow build scripts or pin a specific commit."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
